---
import SectionIntro from "../ui/SectionIntro.astro";
---
<section class="big-picture section-sm">
  <div class="shell">
    <SectionIntro
      eyebrow="The big picture"
      title="Economic outcomes emerge from agent decisions."
      description="TER studies how agents pursue objectives, interpret reality, select actions from the alternatives they perceive as feasible, and interact with reality and with one another. Those actions produce outcomes that reshape the conditions influencing future decisions."
    />

    <div class="flow" role="list" aria-label="Agents, Decisions, Interactions, Outcomes, Feedback">
      <div class="flow-step" role="listitem" data-reveal>
        <span class="flow-index">01</span>
        <h3>Agents</h3>
        <p>Individuals, households, businesses, governments, and institutions pursue objectives under different conditions.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="flow-connector" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <div class="flow-step" role="listitem" data-reveal>
        <span class="flow-index">02</span>
        <h3>Decisions</h3>
        <p>Agents select actions through decision processes shaped by their information, beliefs, perceived feasible actions, valuations, and time horizons.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="flow-connector" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <div class="flow-step" role="listitem" data-reveal>
        <span class="flow-index">03</span>
        <h3>Interactions</h3>
        <p>Selected actions encounter reality and interact with the actions of other agents under prevailing conditions.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="flow-connector" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <div class="flow-step" role="listitem" data-reveal>
        <span class="flow-index">04</span>
        <h3>Outcomes</h3>
        <p>Economic outcomes emerge from those actions and interactions, including markets, prices, institutions, and broader system outcomes.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="flow-connector" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <div class="flow-step" role="listitem" data-reveal>
        <span class="flow-index">05</span>
        <h3>Feedback</h3>
        <p>Outcomes can alter information, constraints, opportunities, valuations, institutions, and the conditions shaping subsequent decisions.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="example" data-reveal>
      <div class="example-head">
        <span class="example-marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        <span class="example-label">Example &middot; a market</span>
      </div>

      <div class="example-stages" role="list" aria-label="Buyers and sellers, Price and quantity emerge, Conditions change">
        <div class="example-stage" role="listitem">
          <h4>Buyers + sellers</h4>
          <p>Buyers and sellers pursue different objectives and make decisions under different information, beliefs, constraints, valuations, and expectations.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="example-connector" aria-hidden="true"></div>

        <div class="example-stage" role="listitem">
          <h4>Price + quantity emerge</h4>
          <p>Their actions interact to produce market outcomes that no single participant independently determines.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="example-connector" aria-hidden="true"></div>

        <div class="example-stage" role="listitem">
          <h4>Conditions change</h4>
          <p>Those outcomes become part of the conditions agents face, influencing information, incentives, opportunities, and subsequent decisions.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .big-picture {
    background: var(--surface-2);
  }

  /* Main TER flow */

  .flow {
    display: flex;
    align-items: stretch;
    margin-top: clamp(3rem, 6vw, 5rem);
  }

  .flow-step {
    display: flex;
    flex: 1;
    flex-direction: column;
    min-height: 13rem;
    padding: 1.75rem 1.5rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: var(--surface);
  }

  .flow-index {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 750;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .flow-step h3 {
    margin: 1rem 0 0;
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 1.8vw, 1.65rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  }

  .flow-step p {
    margin: 0.8rem 0 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .flow-connector {
    position: relative;
    flex: 0 0 2rem;
    align-self: center;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--line);
  }

  .flow-connector::after {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    right: -1px;
    width: 0;
    height: 0;
    border-top: 0.3rem solid transparent;
    border-bottom: 0.3rem solid transparent;
    border-left: 0.4rem solid var(--line);
    content: "";
    transform: translateY(-50%);
  }

  /* Market example */

  .example {
    margin-top: clamp(3.5rem, 7vw, 5.5rem);
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .example-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .example-marker {
    width: 0.55rem;
    height: 0.55rem;
    flex: 0 0 auto;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent);
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 4px
      color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 22%, transparent);
  }

  .example-label {
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 760;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .example-stages {
    display: flex;
    align-items: stretch;
  }

  .example-stage {
    flex: 1;
    padding-right: 1.5rem;
  }

  .example-stage h4 {
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: clamp(1.35rem, 2vw, 1.65rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    line-height: 1.15;
    letter-spacing: -0.025em;
  }

  .example-stage p {
    max-width: 24rem;
    margin: 0.8rem 0 0;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 1rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  .example-connector {
    position: relative;
    flex: 0 0 3rem;
    align-self: center;
    height: 1px;
    margin-right: 1.5rem;
    background: var(--line);
  }

  .example-connector::after {
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    right: -1px;
    width: 0;
    height: 0;
    border-top: 0.3rem solid transparent;
    border-bottom: 0.3rem solid transparent;
    border-left: 0.4rem solid var(--line);
    content: "";
    transform: translateY(-50%);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .flow {
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .flow-step {
      min-height: auto;
    }

    .flow-connector {
      width: 1px;
      height: 1.75rem;
      flex-basis: 1.75rem;
      align-self: center;
    }

    .flow-connector::after {
      top: auto;
      right: 50%;
      bottom: -1px;
      border-top: 0.4rem solid var(--line);
      border-right: 0.3rem solid transparent;
      border-bottom: 0;
      border-left: 0.3rem solid transparent;
      transform: translateX(50%);
    }
  }

  @media (max-width: 800px) {
    .example-stages {
      flex-direction: column;
    }

    .example-stage {
      padding-right: 0;
    }

    .example-stage p {
      max-width: none;
    }

    .example-connector {
      width: 1px;
      height: 2rem;
      flex-basis: 2rem;
      align-self: flex-start;
      margin: 0 0 0 0.25rem;
    }

    .example-connector::after {
      top: auto;
      right: 50%;
      bottom: -1px;
      border-top: 0.35rem solid var(--line);
      border-right: 0.28rem solid transparent;
      border-bottom: 0;
      border-left: 0.28rem solid transparent;
      transform: translateX(50%);
    }
  }
</style>
